--- What shipped (production-complete, no stubs) ---
Native parity port of the web app-shell chrome as a shared surface (the established 4-file convention):

  Layout.Model.cs       Registration (slug=Layout); LayoutI18n (all 24 t() keys/fallbacks extracted verbatim from
                        Layout.tsx); LayoutNavItem/LayoutNavSection projected from the SHARED RouteTable + RouteGroups
                        (the P2 nav core — no parallel route list); the web per-item gating (minVehicles, requiresAuth)
                        + badge flags layered on by path; pure helpers IsVisible / IsActive / FindByPath /
                        FindByExactPath (ports of isVisibleNavItem / isActiveNavPath / findNavItemBy*); pinned/recent/
                        expanded constants (DEFAULT_PINNED, MAX_PINNED=8, MAX_RECENT=3, storage keys); LayoutShellState
                        (loading/ready/empty/failed/stale/offline) + LayoutStatusSnapshot.ResolveState; PII-safe
                        diagnostics.
  Layout.Source.cs      P1/S8 seams: ILayoutLocation (web useLocation), ILayoutPreferences (web useSidebarStyle /
                        useStatusBarPrefs + pinned/recent/expanded localStorage), ILayoutStatusSource (web sidebar
                        useQuery alerts/vehicles/data-repair). In-memory / static defaults for headless + pre-binding.
                        Reuses the existing IAuthModeSource (web useIsForwardAuth) and SidebarStyleChoice.
  Layout.ViewModel.cs   Composes nav state; reproduces the web side-effects (auto-expand active section, recent
                        tracking, pin caps, "active section can't collapse"); commands ToggleSection / ExpandAll /
                        CollapseAll / Pin / Unpin / TogglePinCurrent / RequestRefresh; persists prefs; the pure
                        LayoutProjection (badges, pinned/recent/current resolution, per-state, label resolution).
  Layout.cs             WinUI ContentControl: navigation-landmark sidebar (current-section card + pin toggle, pinned
                        group, grouped sections w/ per-section expand/collapse + alert/vehicle/stale badges), header
                        band (theme picker + Ctrl+K hint + open/close-drawer), banner host + content host. Renders
                        EVERY state (loading ring / ready / empty / failed-with-retry / stale / offline chips with
                        LiveRegion). Narrator names on every interactive element via the i18n facade; view.opened
                        diagnostic on Loaded. Sidebar density follows the SidebarStyleChoice (Linear/Notion/Legacy).

  States bound via the shared state-holder layer; the view performs NO HTTP. Every i18n key resolves through the
  P1/S10 ILocalizer facade (no English literal in the control layer). Charts/maps: none (per the source).

